## .NET / Visual Studio / Rider build artifacts
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
.idea/
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Test results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.trx

## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/

## Runtime/user data — never commit personal libraries, ROMs, BIOS files, or
## config to the repo. During local `dotnet run`/`dotnet build`, UGL creates
## these folders under the build output path (bin\...\), which is already
## excluded above — these extra rules are a safety net in case any of these
## ever end up at the repo root instead (e.g. testing a published build from
## the root, or a future portable-build script that outputs there).
/config/
/roms/
/emulators/
/bios/
/bezels/
/addons/
/retroarch/
/logs/
/media/

## A config\ folder was also found directly under src\ during setup (not just
## the expected build-output location) — excluding it explicitly since it's
## personal data (category/game library), not source code.
src/config/

## Local-only scratch/history — not part of the tracked project.
## _specs\ is deliberately NOT excluded here — those are the project's design
## spec documents and are meant to be tracked.
_backup/
_zip files/

## Publish output (Milestone 17 packaging)
publish/
*.zip

## OS noise
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

## Crash logs
crash.log
